The '''Isle of Eternal Autumn''' is an island located just off the coast of the [[Thalassian Highlands]]. Millenia ago, there were those amongst the elves that sought to plant a new World Tree. However, the endeavor failed, and the cursed tree wrought a transformative spell upon the island, condemning it to an eternal autumn.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|8|Whispers of Autumn}}</ref>

